ord for word\n2. Picture tool and starting pictures: 6 screens × 3 sizes, with fixed clock and fixed weather · Claude (opus-worker) · Build · files: new picture tool, fixed weather files, reference pictures · after: 1 (needs the picture sizes) · level: Complex (a design choice: the picture tool) · size: L · group: B · steps: 100 · proof: 18 pictures saved; the tool compares them with itself with 0 differences; tests still pass\n3. Ice season logic: chip includes early-ice and late-ice lakes, the ice-season line in every popup, the ice wording, and the winter guard \"Ice likely\" · Claude (opus-worker) · Build · files: the conditions logic, the conditions panel, the page, the test file · after: 2 (pictures first) · level: Complex (a design choice: the ice classes and the guard) · size: L · group: C · steps: 100 · proof: new tests per class and for the guard pass; the full test run passes; after-pictures show only the planned changes\n4. README counts: 35 walleye and pike waters shown, nine species, and a test that counts the data; offline cache name change · Claude (sonnet-worker) · Build · files: README, a new small test file, the offline cache file · after: 2 · level: Routine · size: S · group: C · steps: 30 · proof: the new test passes against the data; full test run passes\n5. Red Bait ban line and Bait ban chip, popup close button stays clear of the top-right buttons, slider label for screen readers, after-pictures and reference update, feature list check table · Claude (sonnet-worker) · Build · files: the page, the test file, reference pictures, the feature list · after: 3 and 4 (same page file) · level: Routine · size: L · group: D · steps: 100 · proof: tests for the chip, the line, the popup padding and the label pass; 18 pictures, changed ones all planned; full test run passes\n6. Reviewer, full test run, then one pull request opened ready · Claude · Build · files: none new · after: 5 · level: Routine · size: S · group: E · steps: 30 · proof: reviewer report