hey are: Aerated badge and filter, thin-ice warning Oct–Apr, \"Season and ice\" filter group, ACA winter angling column, Spring Lake note, split-season fix — search: design file features kept\n- [agreed] One pull request for all of Build 1a, opened ready (not draft) after the reviewer; the owner merges — search: one pull request\n\n**Repo facts** · branch `test-with-config` · design commit `1798292` touched `index.html`, `js/conditions.js`, `sw.js`, `README.md`, `data/aca_aeration_roster.csv`, `scripts/test_regression_checks.py` · GitHub `.github/workflows/checks.yml` runs `cd scripts && python -m unittest discover -p \"test_*.py\" -v`, then rebuilds `data/` with `build_history.py` and fails on any diff — this plan changes no file in `data/` · local run: `python3 scripts/test_regression_checks.py` · tests pin `sw.js` precache and the script tags; no new JS file is added, so `SHELL_FILES` stays · no picture test exists today.\n\n**Stage 1 — records** (sonnet-worker; files `FEATURES.md`, `WORKING_RECORD.md`)\n- `FEATURES.md`: by-screen seed shape (`/root/.cache/hz-rules/3.3.1/seed/FEATURES.md`). Sections: Map and pins · Filter panel (incl. \"Season and ice\" group: Open today, Open for ice fishing, Aerated) · Lake popup (verdict line, aeration block with thin-ice warning Oct–Apr, depth, regulation block with Season row and Bait row, photos, actions) · Lake panel · Conditions panel (next 6 h strip, 7-day grid, CLOSED today block, water input, solunar) · Offline (service worker caches) · Data and rules (season parsing incl. split season, ACA winter angling column, Spring Lake note, regulation basis kinds). Source: `README.md` and `index.html`; over-list. Each line ends `— Proof: {test name | picture tests/reference/{screen}-{size}.png}`. Mark the six design-file features \"kept\".\n- `## References`: `Sizes: phone 390×844, ipad 820×1180, pc 1440×900 · Looks: one look` · `Tests: index.html, js/*.js, data/*, scripts/* → cd scripts && python3 -m unittest discover -p \"test